  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_1632.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La noche de este viernes casi 1.200 personas se han congregado en la cena de las fiestas de las calles Vila-real y adyacentes, en este caso en las calles Mestre Caballero y R&iacute;o Mijares. Tras dos jugadas de bingo ha actuado la orquesta Camale&oacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1570.jpg\" alt=\"img_1570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1571.jpg\" alt=\"img_1571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1572.jpg\" alt=\"img_1572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1573.jpg\" alt=\"img_1573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1575.jpg\" alt=\"img_1575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1576.jpg\" alt=\"img_1576\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1577.jpg\" alt=\"img_1577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1578.jpg\" alt=\"img_1578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarrervila-real14/img_1579.jpg\" alt=\"img_1579\" st